{{!
  ScrAPI override of the typescript-axios modelIndex template from OpenAPI Generator 7.26.0
  (the version pinned in openapitools.json). Re-check this file whenever that version changes.

  Change from upstream: when the selection uses no models, upstream writes an empty
  model/index.ts. TypeScript treats an empty file as a script, not a module, so the
  package index's `export * from "./model"` fails to compile (TS2306). The override
  writes `export {};` in that case. With models, the output is the same as upstream.
}}{{#models}}{{#model}}export * from './{{classFilename}}{{importFileExtension}}';{{/model}}
{{/models}}{{^models}}export {};
{{/models}}
